# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of platform.
# This prevents CRLF from leaking into committed blobs via paths that bypass
# git's own line-ending normalization (e.g. direct API uploads). `text=auto`
# lets git auto-detect binary files and leave them untouched; `eol=lf` pins the
# working tree to LF everywhere so Windows checkouts stay consistent with CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
